stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Charging: a free corner slot
    Charging --> Charged: ball full (charge time, Meteor)
    Charged --> Charging: another slot free
    Charged --> Flight: target in range (one launch every 0.05 s)
    Flight --> Flight: hits each enemy it passes (en-route hit, Meteor)
    Flight --> Impact: reaches the aim spot (no lead)
    Impact --> Ring: ring expands to the blast radius (Firaga)
    Impact --> Pellets: N pellets at units in the blast (Firaga)
    Ring --> [*]: one hit each, pops a charge
    Pellets --> Flare: each bursts where it stops (hit or aim spot)
    Pellets --> MiniRing: Firaga capstone - a smaller ring too
    Flare --> [*]: six beams burn for a duration (Hellfire)
    MiniRing --> [*]
